{"id":"95e37bd44b042dee","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-basisthm.md","title":"低基定理","display":"thm-basisthm — 低基定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-basisthm","aliases":["43-thm-basisthm"],"display":"thm-basisthm — 低基定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.16.7, print p.64 / PDF p.84","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-basisthm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-basisthm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-basisthm — 低基定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.16.7, print p.64 / PDF p.84"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 为非空Π⁰₁类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>。序列与集合按特征函数识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ (X&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ (X&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书稿证明每一步保留使第e个跳跃问题一致收敛或发散的非空有效闭子类，再用紧致性取交。原稿树包含方向有明显排印问题；正确过程是递减子类。结论由X′≤T∅′及一般∅′≤TX′得等价。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.16.7, print p.64 / PDF p.84。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 为非空Π⁰₁类，见 [[43-df-pi01class]]。序列与集合按特征函数识别。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ (X'\\equiv_T\\varnothing').","display":true}],"bytes":1149,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-basisthm]] — 低基定理"},{"id":"07115caa7777627c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{Low}$、$\\mathcal R_c$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-low-high]]、[[43-df-randomness-layers]]；低基定理与随机点复杂度刻画见 [[43-thm-basisthm]]、[[43-thm-mlrandom-kolm]]。"}],"outgoing":["cc07cf2b9ec0019e","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}